              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamungazovi nemhosva pachinhu kana muchiuyisa chikamu chakanakisisa chacho; ipapo hamungazosvibisi zvitsvene zvavaIsraeri, uye hamuzofi.' \"",
          "type": "text",
